Falsifies `calendar::verification::rfc3339_output_parses_back_to_itself`.

The defect: `Writer::offset` always writes `+`. A west-of-UTC offset prints as its east-of-UTC mirror and
parses back as a different instant.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert_eq!(DateTime::parse_rfc3339_bytes(text.as_bytes()), Ok(dt))`.

diff --git a/crates/calendar/src/lib.rs b/crates/calendar/src/lib.rs
index 332ce0020..bd20574eb 100644
--- a/crates/calendar/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/calendar/src/lib.rs
@@ -704,3 +704,3 @@ impl Writer {
         let m = offset.minutes();
-        self.byte(if m < 0 { b'-' } else { b'+' });
+        self.byte(b'+');
         let m = m.unsigned_abs();
